    <title>Localizing Copy-Move Forgery in Passport Document Images</title>
    <summary>  We present a transformer-based method for copy-move forgery localization
in photos of official identity documents. Our approach uses patch-level
attention to highlight tampered regions in passport and ID card images.
</summary>
